{
  "name": "sprefa-dl",
  "version": "0.0.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "description": "v6 dl MVP slice: .dl text -> Langium bridge -> rx graph + SQLite tick store -> host effects (extract/sg) -> diag -> v5 LSP compat view, fronted by http (curl is the CLI). Plan: v6/plans/2026-07-24-v6-dl-mvp-slice.md; board: tasks.d.ts.",
